00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:58.470
<b>Episode 28</b>

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:58.470
<b>Episode 28</b>

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:58.470
<b>Yoh's Decision</b>

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:58.470
<b>Yoh's Decision</b>

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:55.610
<b> C'mon Let's Go!</b>

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:58.450
<b>You gotta take him to a doctor, right?</b>

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:03.910
<b>Of course even if he lives, he'll never walk again.</b>

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.660
<b>Shut your face!</b>

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.290
<b>If you're gonna do it, put
some murder behind your punch!</b>

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.520
<b>Stay back, Horohoro.</b>

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:22.360
<b>Who's gonna protect Ren
if you run out of Furyoku.</b>

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:23.300
<b>Huh?</b>

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.680
<b>What kind of puny Furyoku
are you talking about, idiot?!</b>

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:34.940
<b>Your Furyoku is not enough, no
matter what you do, you're dead meat.</b>

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.050
<b>He can't help not knowing about the numbers.</b>

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:44.490
<b>Most Shamans in this tournament don't
know that you can quantify Furyoku.</b>

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:49.540
<b>Only the Patch and Hao-sama's
teams know the secret.</b>

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:54.460
<b>There is a reason that Shamans are
not told their numerical Furyoku values.</b>

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:56.170
<b>Reason?</b>

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.210
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:00.380
<b>Numbers are the problem.</b>

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.930
<b>Whether you can or cannot do something.</b>

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:09.850
<b>People see bad numbers and
lose the confidence they one had.</b>

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:14.400
<b>Grades, performance reviews, salaries.</b>

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:18.110
<b>People see those bad numbers...</b>

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:23.780
<b>And they'll immediately lose
the confidence they once had.</b>

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:28.240
<b>You encounter your limits and
eventually your progress stops.</b>

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:32.250
<b>Furyoku is essentially the product of will.</b>

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.670
<b>But at the same time
it's a very fragile thing.</b>

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:41.340
<b>The Patch believe the Shaman
King must have enormous Furyoku.</b>

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:47.470
<b>So no matter how weak someone is, if there's
unseen potential, we'll have to see it through.</b>

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:55.100
<b>I'm curious to see how you will fight
Hao-sama with Furyoku of only 2000.</b>

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.980
<b>Our Furyoku is only 2000?</b>

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.570
<b>Look how easily shocked you are.</b>

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.620
<b>You can't even stand up.</b>

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.500
<b>These guys are getting boring.</b>

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.400
<b>Time to kill.</b>

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.090
<b>So long.</b>

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.540
<b>Stop it.</b>

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:22.140
<b>If you kill them, you're gonna die, too.</b>

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:38.150
<b>With just one blow...</b>

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:41.400
<b>How did you know where we were?</b>

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.440
<b>Asakura Yoh!</b>

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:48.320
<b>Ren...</b>

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.910
<b>I'm sorry, it's all my fault.</b>

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:57.480
<b>Ren lost his focus when he found out he killed
the brother of one of the 10 officiants.</b>

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.460
<b>How'd you know that?</b>

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:03.090
<b>I see, that's good.</b>

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.930
<b>It means Ren's still got a heart.</b>

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.180
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.760
<b>Ren is stronger than Peyote.</b>

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:15.140
<b>He lost because his remorse rattled him.</b>

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:20.980
<b>It didn’t use to bother him to hurt
people, but that Ren is gone now.</b>

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:23.030
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.950
<b>He's not the person who
killed your brother anymore.</b>

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:31.080
<b>Take your friends
and go, Nickrome.</b>

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.410
<b>It was Silva...</b>

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:38.500
<b>He sent you here and told
you about me, didn’t he?!</b>

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.290
<b>What's with him?</b>

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.800
<b>Aren't you the one doing shady stuff?</b>

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:45.340
<b>What do you mean shady?</b>

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:49.260
<b>You know nothing about
the laws of the Patch!</b>

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.140
<b>I don't care about her</b>

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.020
<b>Leave now, Nickrome!</b>

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.520
<b>Hey, don't just stand there!</b>

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.730
<b>Kill them, quickly!</b>

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.610
<b>These guys are still..!</b>

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.030
<b>Sorry, Nickrome.</b>

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.490
<b>Forget it.</b>

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:11.320
<b>We're no longer in control.</b>

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:15.370
<b>Yeah, especially now
that those two are here.</b>

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:16.500
<b>What?</b>

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.500
<b>Boss Yoh told you to get lost.</b>

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:23.170
<b>If you're smart, you'll do what he says.</b>

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.760
<b>If you still want to fight...</b>

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:27.170
<b>I wouldn't mind</b>

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.640
<b>Wanna rumble, punks?</b>

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.310
<b>Team Funbari Hot Springs...</b>

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.560
<b>Remember this, Asakura Yoh!</b>

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:42.150
<b>My brother Chrom didn't get killed,
he died because he was too soft!</b>

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.400
<b>Nickrome...</b>

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.030
<b>Young master!
Bason...</b>

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:54.030
<b>It's a good thing you're here, Faust!</b>

00:06:58.660 --> 00:06:59.410
<b>What?</b>

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.670
<b>If you don't treat him, Ren will...</b>

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:04.750
<b>Severe trauma to the arteries and heart...</b>

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.750
<b>Punctured lungs...</b>

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:09.170
<b>Trauma to the diaphragm and esophagus...</b>

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.470
<b>These injuries sent him
into a state of severe shock.</b>

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:18.220
<b>There is nothing I can do.</b>

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:22.150
<b>Because his body is already dead.</b>

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.560
<b>Ren is...</b>

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:26.860
<b>Dead...</b>

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:31.360
<b>Once again I couldn't overcome death.</b>

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:33.870
<b>I'm very sorry.</b>

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.410
<b>What do you mean?!</b>

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:40.000
<b>Calm down, Horohoro!</b>

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.420
<b>As long as Ren's soul is still around...</b>

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:46.540
<b>He's not completely dead.</b>

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.590
<b>I know someone who can help him.</b>

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.720
<b>It might still work out somehow.</b>

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:54.220
<b>Don't give up.</b>

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:59.850
<b>Manta, I need a favor.</b>

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:02.270
<b>There's someone I want you to get.</b>

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.060
<b>She may be reluctant...</b>

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.820
<b>But you can't take no for an answer.</b>

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:13.200
<b>Just tell her I'll do anything she asks.</b>

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:17.160
<b>I'm sure she'll agree to help us.</b>

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.840
<b>What's happening?!</b>

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:36.840
<b>Where is Mickey Asakura's team?</b>

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:40.310
<b>They must've chickened out.</b>

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:43.020
<b>We're just too scary for them.</b>

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:44.890
<b>I hope so.</b>

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:48.650
<b>Goldva-sama, is this..?</b>

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:53.320
<b>Mickey Asakura is like a father of those two.</b>

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:57.870
<b>He's probably caught
up in the usual trouble.</b>

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.240
<b>The usual?</b>

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:05.040
<b>A battle of survival involving spirits
outside the official Shaman Fight.</b>

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:10.750
<b>Maybe that's the true
essence of the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:12.840
<b>What's going on?</b>

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:15.470
<b>We were just waiting for Mickey...</b>

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:18.260
<b>And all these ladies
suddenly are here.</b>

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:20.640
<b>And...</b>

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:23.220
<b>They're scary!</b>

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.980
<b>That damn Mickey, what is he doing!</b>

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:31.480
<b>So who wants to be sent to the hospital first?</b>

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:34.110
<b>Hey, she's making some sound.</b>

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:36.150
<b>You're the girl...</b>

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.990
<b>That Hao-sama was flirting with the other day.</b>

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.200
<b>Jealous?</b>

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:48.170
<b>Not really, just wandering
who the hell you think you are.</b>

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.750
<b>Right, Ashcroft?</b>

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:57.170
<b>Anna-sama...</b>

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:58.840
<b>Stand back, Tamao.</b>

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:00.720
<b>Don't engage them</b>

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.260
<b>This pointy lady will handle it.</b>

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.220
<b>Me?</b>

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:09.150
<b>I want to see how powerful
Pyron has become.</b>

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.310
<b>Show it to me.</b>

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.270
<b>Anna-chan...</b>

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:17.280
<b>This is why I hate kids.</b>

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:20.410
<b>Kill them, Ashcroft!</b>

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:29.290
<b>I will allow no one to destroy
the dreams of these children.</b>

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.830
<b>I won't forgive you!</b>

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.460
<b>Dao Dan Do: Rocket Kick!</b>

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:38.590
<b>Sky-Diving Bombardier...</b>

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.760
<b>Bombarding kick!</b>

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.720
<b>Fantastic, Pyron</b>

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.600
<b>But you must remain Alert.</b>

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:52.520
<b>You're right Jun</b>

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.480
<b>I'm still in need of training.</b>

00:10:58.740 --> 00:10:59.990
<b>Ectoplasm.</b>

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.740
<b>So you figured it out.</b>

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:04.550
<b>No wonder Hao-sama is...</b>

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:08.080
<b>Who are you, anyway?</b>

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:12.750
<b>Who knows? Why don't you beat it out of me.</b>

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:20.220
<b>Okay then, Dismember that corpse
and find out who that girl is, Ashcroft</b>

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:22.260
<b>As you wish...</b>

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:25.810
<b>My lady, Kanna Bismarch</b>

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:29.640
<b>First, I apologize
for not introducing myself...</b>

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:34.520
<b>I am a knight in the service
of lady Kanna Bismarch-sama.</b>

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.610
<b>Old iron Ashcroft!</b>

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:41.100
<b>A knight does the bidding of his
mistress and rescues fair damsels.</b>

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:45.700
<b>I have no grievance against
you, but let us fight fairly.</b>

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.410
<b>Is this your idea of chivalry?</b>

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.920
<b>Where is the fairness and honor in this?</b>

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.800
<b>Oh, I was wondering where my left arm was!</b>

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:03.300
<b>I'm careless with my parts,
I'm still getting used to this body.</b>

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:06.760
<b>Then try to stay in one piece.</b>

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.480
<b>I'm a Kung Fu master of justice.</b>

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.980
<b>I never fight dirty.</b>

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.520
<b>A Kung Fu master finds a
way to win in any situation...</b>

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:22.280
<b>Fairly and honorably!</b>

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.780
<b>That suit of armor must be your medium!</b>

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:31.450
<b>And an Over Soul cannot
be formed without a medium.</b>

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:35.120
<b>Therefore, I will destroy it!</b>

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.790
<b>You idiot!</b>

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:41.170
<b>My armor weighs 80 kg!</b>

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:44.800
<b>Do you really think you
can break it with your fists?!</b>

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:54.520
<b>What's this?</b>

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:56.440
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:12:56.730 --> 00:13:01.360
<b>Pyron was missing some
pieces after father tore him apart.</b>

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:05.070
<b>So when I fixed him, I
made a few upgrades.</b>

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:09.530
<b>The Tao Family's modified Jiang Si...</b>

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:11.290
<b>Pyron Kai</b>

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:13.290
<b>He has a missile punch!</b>

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:18.330
<b>Essentially, it's a punching machine
combined with a machine gun.</b>

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:23.210
<b>This gimmick is activated
by one of my talismans.</b>

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:31.100
<b>Launched with magnum force and spun,
Pyron's 120mm fist can penetrate anything.</b>

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.310
<b>Pyron fights of his own volition...</b>

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.730
<b>And I back him up with my talismans.</b>

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:41.020
<b>This is our new style of Over Soul.</b>

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.400
<b>Got a problem with it?</b>

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.780
<b>I do.</b>

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.970
<b>This is a bit too much
for a martial artist...</b>

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.620
<b>Oh but it looks great...</b>

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.080
<b>Pyron.</b>

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.080
<b>Jun...</b>

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:03.420
<b>Jun-san and Pyron-san are such
a cute couple, right, Anna-sama?</b>

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:07.300
<b>He has a wife and a kid...</b>

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.680
<b>But this is no time for chitchat.</b>

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:15.470
<b>The medium isn't the armor.</b>

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:17.480
<b>Ectoplasm</b>

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.980
<b>Her real assault is yet to come.</b>

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:25.440
<b>I know it's urgent...</b>

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:31.690
<b>But driving on high speeds on mountain roads
is dangerous. Please forgive the bumpy ride.</b>

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.160
<b>I don't mind.</b>

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.910
<b>Helping people is an
important part of our cause.</b>

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.670
<b>Thank you, for your words.</b>

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:45.880
<b>I wish that I could broadcast your
words to the whole world via satellite!</b>

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:47.720
<b>U-uhm...</b>

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.050
<b>What is it?</b>

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:52.720
<b>Ah! I'm sorry, I wanted to ask a question!</b>

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.510
<b>Hahaha, it's okay.</b>

00:14:54.970 --> 00:15:00.350
<b>The only person who can save this situation
is our holy girl, Maiden-sama, right?</b>

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:02.150
<b>I'm surprised.</b>

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:06.730
<b>I didn't expect you'd respond so quickly.</b>

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:11.320
<b>Then you thought we were heartless people?</b>

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.200
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:16.160
<b>I mean, no! That's not what...</b>

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.460
<b>Manta-san, you're a very funny person.</b>

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.040
<b>Maiden-san...</b>

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.880
<b>This is so much fun.</b>

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:30.220
<b>I haven't felt this happy in years.</b>

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:36.180
<b>Not since I entered the Iron Maiden.</b>

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.020
<b>I know this is a bad time...</b>

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:43.770
<b>but perhaps it's good for
me to get out once in a while.</b>

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:48.690
<b>Don't forget, this is an emergency, you're
traveling incognito.</b>

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:51.450
<b>You're right, Marco.</b>

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:55.320
<b>But I had a different question...</b>

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:56.950
<b>What are your terms?</b>

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:05.460
<b>You're the X-Laws, and Yoh-kun and Ren-kun
are your opponents in the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:09.130
<b>True, but Hao is our true enemy.</b>

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:18.140
<b>As you may already know, a near-death
experience boosts a Shaman's Furyoku enormously.</b>

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:26.860
<b>Hao has accumulated an astounding 1.25 million
Furyoku by repeatedly dying and reincarnating.</b>

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:33.400
<b>By subjecting myself to severe torture
and remaining in a near-death state...</b>

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.700
<b>I increase my Furyoku daily.</b>

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:42.910
<b>If what you say is true and
the worst has befallen to Ren...</b>

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:47.210
<b>His Furyoku will increase
by at least 50.000 points.</b>

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.460
<b>50.000?!</b>

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:54.260
<b>But even more disturbing is the fact
that Asakura Yoh is Hao's twin brother.</b>

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:55.760
<b>How'd you find out?</b>

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:59.140
<b>We have many allies.</b>

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:03.350
<b>We can no longer accept his filthy power...</b>

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:07.980
<b>Or allow such a potentially
catastrophic contender to proceed.</b>

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:10.860
<b>My terms are simple...</b>

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:14.570
<b>He must withdraw from the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.780
<b>Iron Maiden?</b>

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.950
<b>One of the three main contenders.</b>

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.580
<b>The leader of the X-Laws.</b>

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:26.080
<b>How could you be so stupid?!</b>

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.920
<b>What was that for?
Idiot!</b>

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:32.550
<b>You can't obligate yourself to them!</b>

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:35.340
<b>They're your enemies!</b>

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:38.510
<b>One thing's for sure, you're
not gonna come out ahead!</b>

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.300
<b>I know.</b>

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.810
<b>But I had no choice.</b>

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:46.020
<b>It's our only choice.</b>

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:48.270
<b>Yoh-dono...</b>

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.190
<b>But that doesn't mean you have to...</b>

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.940
<b>Boss Yoh always puts his friends first.</b>

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.530
<b>That's why this is my best place.</b>

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.870
<b>I support whatever decision he makes.</b>

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:07.500
<b>Thanks to Yoh-kun and
Anna-san, Eliza and I were reunited.</b>

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:11.000
<b>It would be a sin for
me to go against them.</b>

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.670
<b>You guys too?!</b>

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:13.710
<b>Stop it.</b>

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.380
<b>Don't waste your breath on these fools.</b>

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:21.550
<b>I want to save him, too.</b>

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:26.310
<b>If he dies, a piece of our
dreams will die with him.</b>

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.140
<b>That's right.</b>

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:34.650
<b>That's why I fought until
my Furyoku was exhausted.</b>

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:39.740
<b>And then he comes along and
beats them with a single blow.</b>

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.370
<b>I can't stand it!</b>

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:46.790
<b>How could I lose to a wimp who'd
throw everything to save a friend?!</b>

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:55.340
<b>But in the end, this is
survival of the fittest.</b>

00:18:56.000 --> 00:19:00.090
<b>And I don't care if I
sound like a sore loser.</b>

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:05.040
<b>When they get here, make
sure you kiss their feet real good.</b>

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:10.850
<b>As his teammate, I won't
forgive you if this fails.</b>

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:15.860
<b>If he dies, I'll get you,
even if it's the last thing I do.</b>

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:17.860
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.530
<b>Hey wait, you're overreacting!</b>

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:25.330
<b>Yoh-dono...</b>

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:27.490
<b>It's okay.</b>

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:32.330
<b>Good luck, Horohoro, Chocolove.</b>

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.210
<b>Forgive me, Yoh-dono!</b>

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.380
<b>I wasn't strong enough!</b>

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.550
<b>It wasn't your fault.</b>

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:44.970
<b>And if this works, Ren's
gonna be stronger than ever.</b>

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:46.050
<b>What?</b>

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:51.140
<b>He'll have so much
Furyoku, I'll be irrelevant.</b>

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.690
<b>Then he'll have a good shot at winning.</b>

00:19:55.480 --> 00:20:00.070
<b>If the people of this world could really
be free, there wouldn't be so much strife.</b>

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:03.780
<b>Yoh-dono, what are you thinking?</b>

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:08.990
<b>You seemed to have
grasped what's going on.</b>

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.500
<b>Is that because you're Hao's
brother?</b>

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:14.960
<b>Asakura Yoh-kun.</b>

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.920
<b>Yoh-kun...</b>

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:20.960
<b>Sorry, Manta</b>

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.970
<b>And thank you for coming, Lyserg.</b>

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.270
<b>More importantly, is the maiden here?</b>

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.100
<b>Address her properly!</b>

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:35.770
<b>Maiden-sama is in the car.</b>

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:39.900
<b>You will have the honor of
gazing upon her blessed form.</b>

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.990
<b>But only if you agree to our terms.</b>

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:46.160
<b>So you figured it out...</b>

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.820
<b>About me.</b>

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:51.330
<b>We have an excellent intelligence network.</b>

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.410
<b>I was surprised...</b>

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:57.210
<b>To learn that the loathsome
Hao is your brother.</b>

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.250
<b>You're a fool.</b>

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:04.840
<b>You'd have great power, yet you'd
sacrifice everything for a friend.</b>

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:09.390
<b>That is not worthy of a king.</b>

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:10.760
<b>Hmm?</b>

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:16.350
<b>A king must make sacrifices
to protect his kingdom.</b>

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:22.780
<b>But a king must never sacrifice himself.</b>

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:24.650
<b>Foolish.</b>

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:26.820
<b>It's unimaginably folly.</b>

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:31.700
<b>You never had what it
takes to be the Shaman King.</b>

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.290
<b>You made a wise decision.</b>

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:40.040
<b>So what happens now?</b>

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:42.840
<b>Tell me your terms.</b>

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:46.050
<b>Ren's life is on the line.</b>

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:52.720
<b>Sheesh...</b>

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:57.270
<b>I never thought things
would turn out like this.</b>

00:21:58.980 --> 00:21:59.810
<b>Everyone…</b>

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:02.980
<b>You all took care of me.</b>

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:05.650
<b>Thanks for everything.</b>

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:09.870
<b>And I'm sorry...</b>

00:22:12.620 --> 00:22:13.490
<b>Anna.</b>

